{"id":48245,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/challenge-passadicos-do-mondego\/"},"modified":"2026-09-29T18:28:33","modified_gmt":"2026-09-29T17:28:33","slug":"challenge-passadicos-do-mondego","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/challenge-passadicos-do-mondego\/","title":{"rendered":"Challenge Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Challenge Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Challenge Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego 2026<\/strong> (3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>15 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, convidando-te a percorrer um dos cen\u00e1rios naturais mais impressionantes de Portugal, em pleno <strong>Parque Natural da Serra da Estrela<\/strong> e <strong>Estrela Geopark Mundial da UNESCO<\/strong>. Organizado pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio da Guarda<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Videmonte<\/strong>, o evento assinala o quarto anivers\u00e1rio da abertura ao p\u00fablico desta grandiosa infraestrutura com inscri\u00e7\u00f5es <strong>100% gratuitas<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida no <strong>Largo de Santo Ant\u00f3nio<\/strong> em <strong>Videmonte<\/strong> e quil\u00f3metro zero na entrada dos passadi\u00e7os, o tra\u00e7ado linear de <strong>12,5 km<\/strong> (+448m \/ -700m D) serpenteia o vale profundo e as escarpas rochosas do Rio Mondego at\u00e9 \u00e0 imponente <strong>Barragem do Caldeir\u00e3o<\/strong>, alternando pontes suspensas, patrim\u00f3nio de arqueologia industrial e trilhos serranos. Na vertente competitiva de Trail Running, os atletas enfrentam ainda a novidade do <strong>Desafio Vertical<\/strong> nos \u00faltimos 1,4 km (+210m D+ e 665 degraus at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta), existindo tamb\u00e9m a vertente de Caminhada l\u00fadica. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte de regresso em autocarro, transporte de sacos, seguro, abastecimentos e medalha de finalista.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">15 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Videmonte (Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego), Guarda<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12,5 km (Trail Running) e 12,5 km (Caminhada)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Munic\u00edpio da Guarda e Junta de Freguesia de Videmonte<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Tempo Limite (Cut-off)<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">3h30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/assets.acorrer.pt\/media\/9984\/6aad09ff31cdf_Regulamento.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Trail Running 12,5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 448m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/11 (dorsal c\/chip, seguro, transporte e medalha))<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 12,5K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 448m D+<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Gratuita:<\/strong> 0.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/11 (seguro, abastecimento, transporte e medalha))<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Challenge Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida no Largo de Santo Ant\u00f3nio em Videmonte (km0 na entrada dos passadi\u00e7os) e meta na Barragem do Caldeir\u00e3o, no concelho da Guarda.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e modalidades dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e de duas vertentes com o mesmo tra\u00e7ado linear de 12,5 km: Trail Running (competitivo e cronometrado por chip) e Caminhada (vertente l\u00fadica de lazer).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que \u00e9 o novo Desafio Vertical?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Desafio Vertical \u00e9 um tro\u00e7o cronometrado integrado na prova de Trail Running 12,5K entre a Ponte da Mizarela e a meta na Barragem do Caldeir\u00e3o, com 1,4 km de extens\u00e3o, 210 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo e a supera\u00e7\u00e3o de 665 degraus.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quanto custa a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail e na Caminhada \u00e9 100% gratuita, incluindo dorsal com chip (no trail), seguro, abastecimentos, medalha de finalista e transporte de apoio. O almo\u00e7o de conv\u00edvio (5 \u20ac) e a t-shirt comemorativa (7 \u20ac) s\u00e3o op\u00e7\u00f5es adicionais.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte entre a meta e o ponto de partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura autocarros para o transporte dos participantes desde a zona de meta na Barragem do Caldeir\u00e3o de regresso a Videmonte, bem como transporte de sacos de atletas at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Challenge Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Videmonte (Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego), Guarda\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Guarda\", \"addressRegion\": \"Guarda\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio da Guarda e Junta de Freguesia de Videmonte\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Challenge Passadi\u00e7os do Mondego 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no domingo, 15 de novembro de 2026, com partida no Largo de Santo Ant\u00f3nio em Videmonte (km0 na entrada dos passadi\u00e7os) e meta na Barragem do Caldeir\u00e3o, no concelho da Guarda.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e modalidades dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento disp\u00f5e de duas vertentes com o mesmo tra\u00e7ado linear de 12,5 km: Trail Running (competitivo e cronometrado por chip) e Caminhada (vertente l\u00fadica de lazer).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que \u00e9 o novo Desafio Vertical?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Desafio Vertical \u00e9 um tro\u00e7o cronometrado integrado na prova de Trail Running 12,5K entre a Ponte da Mizarela e a meta na Barragem do Caldeir\u00e3o, com 1,4 km de extens\u00e3o, 210 metros de desn\u00edvel positivo e a supera\u00e7\u00e3o de 665 degraus.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quanto custa a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que inclui?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o no Trail e na Caminhada \u00e9 100% gratuita, incluindo dorsal com chip (no trail), seguro, abastecimentos, medalha de finalista e transporte de apoio. O almo\u00e7o de conv\u00edvio (5 \u20ac) e a t-shirt comemorativa (7 \u20ac) s\u00e3o op\u00e7\u00f5es adicionais.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura transporte entre a meta e o ponto de partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura autocarros para o transporte dos participantes desde a zona de meta na Barragem do Caldeir\u00e3o de regresso a Videmonte, bem como transporte de sacos de atletas at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":69009,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[212,726,820],"event_type_3":[744],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list